{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/learn/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/page,_N_T_/learn/elder-triple-screen-limits"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--2DJ2zhzL_dHSrK5QsdDKA--><html lang=\"zh-TW\" data-density=\"comfortable\" data-font-size=\"standard\" class=\"__variable_07e1b6 __variable_cc7473 h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/6e1768769e6f59a2-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ab2e3a11646b0499-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/75c047ba52e43fcc.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/aa90c9a426448e43.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/e55779c04dd245e2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8c57d5c3b938342e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/3eaf36e367672966.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-ab54a41c275880be.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-acf4587a940f1946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/learn/%5Bslug%5D/page-f7b99344f7e2ee16.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>艾爾德三螢幕怎麼看？3個限制，別當聖盃｜股市大佬 TradeBoss</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"亞歷山大·艾爾德的公開著作裡，有一套後來被叫成三螢幕的做法：用較大的週期看方向，用較小的週期找時機，中間再用另一層過濾。聽起來很完整，所以容易被當成聖盃。完整感本身就是風險。多重週期能跨的是「大方向與小時機打架」，跨不了的是費用、假訊號與你自己的執行。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-theme');if(t!=='light'&&t!=='dark')t='dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);document.documentElement.style.colorScheme=(t==='light'?'light':'dark');}catch(e){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark');}})();(function(){try{if(localStorage.getItem('obsidian-comfort-read')==='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('comfort-read');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var s=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-updown');if(s==='us')document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-updown','us');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var prefs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('bs-preferences-v1')||'{}');var root=document.documentElement;prefs=prefs&&typeof prefs==='object'?prefs:{};root.setAttribute('data-font-size',['standard','large','xlarge','huge'].indexOf(prefs.fontSize)>=0?prefs.fontSize:'standard');root.setAttribute('data-density',prefs.density==='compact'?'compact':'comfortable');}catch(e){}})();</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground selection:bg-cyan/30 review-mode pb-40 lg:pb-16\" data-review-theme=\"dark\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link fixed left-3 top-3 z-[80] -translate-y-24 rounded-xl bg-accent px-4 py-2 font-black text-bg shadow-lg transition focus:translate-y-0\">跳到主要內容</a><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_wrap__LIQ8G\"><article class=\"LearnArticle_article__2nBbk\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_meta__etj_G\"><a class=\"LearnArticle_cat__GQMlg\" href=\"/learn?c=stories\">人物與市場史</a><span class=\"LearnArticle_read__QEj6a\">閱讀約 3 分鐘</span></p><h1 class=\"LearnArticle_title__0_la8\">艾爾德三螢幕怎麼看？3個限制，別當聖盃</h1><details class=\"LearnArticle_toc__LcSAa\"><summary class=\"LearnArticle_tocSummary__YBddG\">本文目錄</summary><ol class=\"LearnArticle_tocList__Rq_Lz\"><li><a href=\"#sec-1\">一、它本來要解決的打架</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-2\">二、三個限制</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-3\">三、和週線日線衝突那題的關係</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-4\">四、聖盃感從哪來</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-5\">五、最小動作</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-6\">常見問題 FAQ</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-7\">總結</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-8\">延伸閱讀</a></li></ol></details><div class=\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\">亞歷山大·艾爾德的公開著作裡，有一套後來被叫成三螢幕的做法：用較大的週期看方向，用較小的週期找時機，中間再用另一層過濾。聽起來很完整，所以容易被當成聖盃。完整感本身就是風險。多重週期能跨的是「大方向與小時機打架」，跨不了的是費用、假訊號與你自己的執行。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\"><b class=\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\">本文重點</b><ul class=\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\"><li>多週期是在處理打架，不是在提高保證</li><li>三層都同意時，也可能只是同一種擁擠</li><li>參數一調，完整感會變成過度配適</li></ul></div><section id=\"sec-1\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">一、它本來要解決的打架</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">日線說往上、五分線說往下，這種衝突每天都有。公開做法的精神是：先承認大週期與小週期在回答不同問題。這層仍然有用。有用的是承認衝突，不是相信三層排好就不會錯。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>不同週期問不同題</li><li>衝突是常態</li><li>排好不是保證</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-2\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">二、三個限制</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">第一，大週期看錯，小週期只是把錯的方向執行得更勤快。第二，三層都用同類指標，仍是單一尺子。第三，短週期那層最容易讓你為了「找時機」而過度交易。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\"><table class=\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\"><thead><tr><th>看起來完整</th><th>限制</th><th>先怎麼補</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>大方向對了</td><td>大方向也會錯</td><td>大週期也要作廢</td></tr><tr><td>三層都同意</td><td>可能同一種擁擠</td><td>再加一種不同問題</td></tr><tr><td>小週期很準時</td><td>準時也有費用</td><td>先算划不划算</td></tr><tr><td>調參讓它更美</td><td>樣本內配適</td><td>留一段不調</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"sec-3\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">三、和週線日線衝突那題的關係</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">題庫裡有「週線與日線衝突怎麼辦」。艾爾德提供的是其中一種回答：先聽較大的。回答不是唯一，也不是永遠對。你要寫的是：衝突時我聽誰、聽錯了怎麼離開。</p><ol class=\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\"><li>先寫衝突時聽誰</li><li>再寫聽錯的離開</li><li>不要只寫進場</li></ol><figure class=\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\">✓衝突聽誰✓聽錯怎麼走✓頻率上限</div><figcaption class=\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\">先寫</figcaption></figure></section><section id=\"sec-4\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">四、聖盃感從哪來</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">三個螢幕、三個步驟、聽起來像完整系統。完整系統的傳播成本低。真正完整的系統還要包括：做不到時怎麼辦、連續虧時停不停、費用吃不吃得消。少這三行，就還是示意圖。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>示意圖≠系統</li><li>執行與費用要寫進去</li><li>連續虧的規則要先有</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-5\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">五、最小動作</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">若你已經在用多週期，打開日誌看：小週期有沒有讓你的交易次數不合理地增加。有，就先修頻率，再修螢幕。</p></section><section id=\"sec-6\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">常見問題 FAQ</h2><div class=\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\"><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>一定要三層嗎？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">兩層就能處理部分打架。層數不是愈多愈好。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>大週期永遠比較對嗎？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">不是。大週期錯起來拖更久。所以也要作廢。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>短線玩家要不要用？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">更要先算費用。短週期那層最會引誘你多做。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>和蒙格的格子差在哪？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">三螢幕仍可能全是技術尺。格子要不同種類的問題。</p></details></div></section><section id=\"sec-7\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">總結</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">三螢幕用來處理週期打架，不是聖盃。大週期也會錯，三層同意可能是擁擠，小週期會引誘多做。先寫衝突規則與費用。</p></section><section id=\"sec-8\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">延伸閱讀</h2><ul class=\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\"><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/munger-mental-models-for-markets\">蒙格思維模型</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/backtest-pitfalls-you-should-avoid\">回測的坑</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/beginner-which-timeframe\">新手該從哪種週期開始</a></li></ul></section><div class=\"LearnArticle_related__9qV55\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_relatedTitle__RXfrl\">相關文章</p><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/munger-mental-models-for-markets\">蒙格思維模型</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/backtest-pitfalls-you-should-avoid\">回測的坑</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/beginner-which-timeframe\">新手該從哪種週期開始</a></div></div></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[81259,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[89379,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[98924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[10021,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[10528,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/