le_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"二、三個限制\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"第一，大週期看錯，小週期只是把錯的方向執行得更勤快。第二，三層都用同類指標，仍是單一尺子。第三，短週期那層最容易讓你為了「找時機」而過度交易。\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"看起來完整\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"限制\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"先怎麼補\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"大方向對了\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"大方向也會錯\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"大週期也要作廢\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"三層都同意\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"可能同一種擁擠\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"再加一種不同問題\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"小週期很準時\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"準時也有費用\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"先算划不划算\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"調參讓它更美\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"樣本內配適\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"留一段不調\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-3\",{\"id\":\"sec-3\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"三、和週線日線衝突那題的關係\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"題庫裡有「週線與日線衝突怎麼辦」。艾爾德提供的是其中一種回答：先聽較大的。回答不是唯一，也不是永遠對。你要寫的是：衝突時我聽誰、聽錯了怎麼離開。\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"先寫衝突時聽誰\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"再寫聽錯的離開\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"不要只寫進場\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\",\"children\":\"✓衝突聽誰✓聽錯怎麼走✓頻率上限\"}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\",\"children\":\"先寫\"}]]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-4\",{\"id\":\"sec-4\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"四、聖盃感從哪來\"}],[\"$L18\",\"$L19\"]]}],\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\"],\"$L1e\"]}]]}]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"三個螢幕、三個步驟、聽起來像完整系統。完整系統的傳播成本低。真正完整的系統還要包括：做不到時怎麼辦、連續虧時停不停、費用吃不吃得消。少這三行，就還是示意圖。\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"示意圖≠系統\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"執行與費用要寫進去\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"連續虧的規則要先有\"}]]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-5\",{\"id\":\"sec-5\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"五、最小動作\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"若你已經在用多週期，打開日誌看：小週期有沒有讓你的交易次數不合理地增加。有，就先修頻率，再修螢幕。\"}]]]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-6\",{\"id\":\"sec-6\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}],[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"一定要三層嗎？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"兩層就能處理部分打架。層數不是愈多愈好。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"大週期永遠比較對嗎？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"不是。大週期錯起來拖更久。所以也要作廢。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"短線玩家要不要用？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"更要先算費用。短週期那層最會引誘你多做。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"和蒙格的格子差在哪？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"三螢幕仍可能全是技術尺。格子要不同種類的問題。\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-7\",{\"id\":\"sec-7\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"總結\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"三螢幕用來處理週期打架，不是聖盃。大週期也會錯，三層同意可能是擁擠，小週期會引誘多做。先寫衝突規則與費用。\"}]]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-8\",{\"id\":\"sec-8\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}],[[\"$\",\"ul\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-蒙格思維模型\",{\"href\":\"/learn/munger-mental-models-for-markets\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"蒙格思維模型\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-回測的坑\",{\"href\":\"/learn/backtest-pitfalls-you-should-avoid\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"回測的坑\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-新手該從哪種週期\",{\"href\":\"/learn/beginner-which-timeframe\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"新手該從哪種週期開始\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_related__9qV55\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_relatedTitle__RXfrl\",\"children\":\"相關文章\"}],[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"munger-mental-models-for-markets\",{\"href\":\"/learn/munger-mental-models-for-markets\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\",\"children\"